{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49619","headline":"渔歌子 三 · 李珣","name":"渔歌子 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"柳垂丝，花满树，莺啼楚岸春天暮。\n櫂轻舟，出深浦，缓唱渔郎归去。\n罢垂纶，还酌醑，孤村遥指云遮处。\n下长汀，临深渡，惊起一行沙鹭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李珣","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49619.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49619","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}